Pick the strongest direction — the one that feels most clear, human, and watchable.

{{method}}

Outline the piece scene by scene. For each scene:
- Slug line: INT/EXT, location, time of day, duration [4s], [6s], or [8s]
- One sentence describing what happens in the scene (concrete action, not vibes)

Keep it grounded. Each scene should connect clearly to the next.
